{"id":"031def7d5c89ab92","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md","title":"Ground Axiom","display":"df-ground-axiom — Ground Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ground-axiom","aliases":["58-df-ground-axiom","Ground Axiom"],"display":"df-ground-axiom — Ground Axiom","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ground-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ground-axiom</span><span>Ground Axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ground-axiom — Ground Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,V\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(W,V\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(V)\\land\\forall W\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Class}_S(W)\\land W\\subseteq V\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to W=V\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}axiom} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(V)\\land\\forall W\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Class}_S(W)\\land W\\subseteq V\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to W=V\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ground axiom: asserts that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is not a nontrivial set-forcing extension of a proper inner model.</li>\n<li>Ground model: inner model of ZF; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> obtained by forcing over the ground.</li>\n<li>Shoenfield: absoluteness; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span> statements can't distinguish grounds</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hamkins, The Ground Axiom</li>\n<li>Reitz, The Ground Axiom</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_o